<p class="lh">Web initiatives fail less often because of poor ideas and more often because of unmanaged delivery flow. This infographic presents the full lifecycle SanguineIT uses to take web programs from concept to launch and sustained growth, with clear accountability at each phase. It is designed for product owners, PMOs, and engineering leaders who need to align strategy, design, development, quality, and operations under one transparent execution model.</p>

<p class="lh">The visual emphasizes that each phase has specific objectives, decision gates, and measurable outputs. When teams skip these controls, they usually face avoidable issues: rework during build, unstable launches, and post-release backlog inflation. By contrast, lifecycle discipline reduces uncertainty and enables faster delivery without sacrificing quality, accessibility, security, or SEO readiness.</p>

